l, like Noida 7X (near FNG) and the Noida expressway corridor. These areas have good fundamentals and are getting better connected, which means they will be worth more in the long run.","3BhkFlatNoidaSale":"Find large 3 BHK apartments in Noida, which is the most popular type of apartment and has seen a healthy 12.1% annual price increase. These are premium homes and usually range from Rs 1.5 crore to 3 crores; and offer all conveniences, comfort and a good lifestyle-oriented living. They offer enough space for growing families, and generally span over 1500 sq ft to 2500 sq ft of living space. Some of the best areas in Noida for 3 BHK flats are Sectors 150, Sector 137 and Sector 43. Good connectivity and sound infrastructure have boosted rates. Now  with the upcoming Jewar Airport, prices are likely to accelerate even more in the times ahead.",RtmFlatNoidaSale:"Find ready-to-move-in apartments in Noida averaging \u20b913,378 psf, with immediate possession and no risk of construction. Nearby areas like Central Noida, Golf Marg and the Noida Expressway have new development options for a first home (1 BHK), family unit (2 BHK) or high-end living (3 BHK). Each of these completed developments also provide you access to current community infrastructure. The RM sector is experiencing continued supply growth of 5%, as well as consistent quarterly appreciation of 1.0%. Therefore, these ready to occupy buildings combine convenience with potential for increased investment values in the most favorable real estate market in India."}),l={bangalore:"https://www.magicbricks.com/residential-projects-in-bangalore-nprid",hyderabad:"https://www.magicbricks.com/residential-projects-in-hyderabad-nprid",mumbai:"https://www.magicbricks.com/residential-projects-in-mumbai-nprid",chennai:"https://www.magicbricks.com/residential-projects-in-chennai-nprid",pune:"https://www.magicbricks.com/residential-projects-in-pune-nprid",thane:"https://www.magicbricks.com/residential-projects-in-thane-nprid"